 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "The Idol's Last Serenade"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "퇴출행성 세레나데"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Kwon Jae-seong, a top idol at the peak of his career, makes an unexpected decision— To step away from the spotlight and return to his hometown for a break. There, he finds Lee Soo-ah, his childhood friend, who is now standing at the crossroads of adulthood, preparing for her own future. Their last goodbye wasn’t a good one. But before they part ways again, before life pulls them down separate paths— Jae-seong is determined to make sure Soo-ah never forgets him. One last chance. One final moment. A love that was left unfinished."
  },
